WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.260
It’s Halloween!

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:05.700
The media say

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:07.000
better watch out.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.691
Halloween is the deadliest holiday

00:00:09.691 --> 00:00:13.720
Within minutes this little pirate costume disintegrated.

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:16.760
People are injecting gummies just like this these days

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:18.180
with drugs.

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:18.980
Really?

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:20.840
That’s what we should worry about?

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:21.940
trick or treat

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:23.300
No! That’s absurd.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:25.820
Those stories have been around for decades.

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:27.400
They’re not true,

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:30.260
though adults find plenty of other things

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:31.500
to worry about.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.020
What do you fear on Halloween?

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:34.640
I'm scared of bats.

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:35.340
Bats?

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:36.100
Yes.

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:38.640
Do you really think they might really hurt you?

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:40.620
I think so because their wings are flapping

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:42.820
and they're really long.

00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:43.640
Sharks.

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:44.980
I hate rats, man.

00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:47.540
I guess like creepy old people.

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:49.600
Uh oh, does that include me?

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:51.600
I am terrified of spiders.

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.240
She believes many Americans

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:55.000
are killed by spiders.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:57.020
I’m gonna go with at least a thousand.

00:00:57.020 --> 00:00:58.620
Actually…three,

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:00.520
says the National Safety Council.

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:03.380
I have an irrational fear of balloons.

00:01:03.380 --> 00:01:04.300
Horses.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:06.540
And you think you're more likely to be killed by a horse

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:08.020
than other risks?

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:08.820
Probably not

00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:11.980
but it's our fears are often not very logical.

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:14.120
Exactly! People fear…

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:17.200
Anything that's creepy and unknown right?

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:20.540
I'm super afraid of like clowns.

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:21.380
Clowns.

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:22.260
Why clowns?

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:23.760
They're just a little freaky.

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:25.340
I'm scared they're gonna chase after me.

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:31.000
I just saw It, so I think I'm in that kind of... clowns.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:33.220
Yeah, I think that’s what I'm scared of right now.

00:01:33.220 --> 00:01:36.080
Americans worry about so much.

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:37.600
What might actually

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:38.880
physically harm you?

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:40.880
Gosh, what couldn't kill you over nowadays?

00:01:40.880 --> 00:01:42.880
Like murder, maybe?

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:44.920
Everybody's crazy these days.

00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:46.080
Mean people.

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:46.760
Trump.

00:01:46.760 --> 00:01:47.880
What scares you?

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:48.840
Heights.

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:49.760
Why heights?

00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:51.000
Because I can't control it.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:52.960
Aha, there’s an insight!

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:55.520
Losing control adds to our fears.

00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:56.760
In cars

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:58.080
we feel in control,

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:01.680
but flying scares many people.

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:04.080
I got on a plane today and I was freaking out.

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:06.080
Hold on…

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:08.120
there are more than 90 deaths a day

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:09.880
from car crashes,

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:11.560
but no one’s died for years

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:13.440
in a commercial American plane.

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:15.200
I'm scared of getting hit by the subway.

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:17.240
There's a lot of things that scare me today.

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:19.240
There's a lot of things going on in our world

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:20.120
that is scary.

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:20.880
No!

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:21.680
Wait!

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:23.600
Despite all the media hype

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:25.960
about a thousand risks,

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:29.880
life today is safer …than ever before.

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:31.640
It’s not good to fear so much

00:02:31.640 --> 00:02:32.640
because fear

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:34.800
is a friend of big government.

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:36.000
Whenever there’s an accident,

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:38.280
the media push politicians to say,

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:39.680
“there ought to be a law!”

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:42.040
Ban all consumer fireworks.

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:43.920
And worried people agree.

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:45.480
No I don't think they should be allowed

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:47.640
unless they're done by professionals.

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:50.080
Vicious dogs need to be regulated.

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:52.000
They’ll bite you

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:52.920
and grab you

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:53.560
and kill you.

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:56.320
We are in grave danger, frankly in this country

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:57.360
because of terrorism.

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:59.640
Terrorism is the big scare now,

00:02:59.640 --> 00:03:02.120
but even including 9/11,

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:04.440
death from terrorism is rare.

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:06.320
The National Safety Council says

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:07.720
more people die

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:09.440
crossing the street,

00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:10.880
in bathtubs,

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:13.000
or tripping over furniture.

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:14.440
Here in Times Square,

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:16.680
the risk of terrorism is probably higher,

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:18.720
but this man understands

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:20.400
it's still a small risk.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:21.760
Because if you look at the odds,

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:23.520
you look at the numbers, it's,

00:03:23.520 --> 00:03:24.800
it's very small.

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:27.080
The big risks in America today are

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:28.480
eating too much,

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:29.640
drinking too much,

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:30.440
smoking,

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:32.440
and driving recklessly.

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:33.960
What do you worry about?

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:35.680
Bad drivers.

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:37.560
You know, that's the most sensible answer

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:38.280
I've gotten here

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:39.040
all day.

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:40.320
Happy Halloween.

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:41.760
Enjoy the moment.

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:43.760
Life in America is safer

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:44.880
than ever before.

